1
00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:40,070
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,090 --> 00:01:43,030
[Episode 15: A Bite to Eat]

3
00:01:44,550 --> 00:01:46,930
There should have been an extra meal
for the night shift.

4
00:01:46,930 --> 00:01:48,860
But they haven't delivered it yet.

5
00:01:50,580 --> 00:01:51,509
Have some water.

6
00:01:53,850 --> 00:01:54,440
Here.

7
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:05,970
Get up, get up!

8
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,640
Get up, get up!

9
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,770
Get up. Stop sleeping!

10
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:13,930
Get up, get up!

11
00:02:12,370 --> 00:02:14,500
[Supervisor of Canal Transport,
Xue Baguan]

12
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,700
Stop sleeping!

13
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:18,860
What are you doing?

14
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:19,400
Hurry up.

15
00:02:21,770 --> 00:02:22,360
Get up!

16
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:22,840
Hurry up and move!

17
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,960
Go. Hurry up!

18
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:26,510
Go over there.

19
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:27,930
Move.

20
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:29,120
Hurry up. Move.

21
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,210
Hurry up. Move!

22
00:02:36,450 --> 00:02:37,230
Get moving!

23
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,079
Hurry up.

24
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,210
Go. Hurry up.

25
00:02:39,329 --> 00:02:40,290
Hurry up. Move!

26
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,770
Hurry up. Move!

27
00:02:42,210 --> 00:02:42,840
Move!

28
00:02:44,590 --> 00:02:45,380
Move!

29
00:02:46,490 --> 00:02:47,329
Hurry up.

30
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,090
Squat down. Behave.

31
00:02:51,930 --> 00:02:52,680
Who?

32
00:02:53,930 --> 00:02:55,120
Who did this?

33
00:02:56,210 --> 00:02:58,930
You ungrateful scoundrels!

34
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,880
Playing tricks, huh?

35
00:03:03,170 --> 00:03:04,960
Are you?

36
00:03:05,170 --> 00:03:06,500
Are you tired of living?

37
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:10,360
You didn't pull the boat properly,

38
00:03:11,220 --> 00:03:13,330
and caused me so much trouble.

39
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,840
I'll teach you a lesson!

40
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,610
Who did this?

41
00:03:17,770 --> 00:03:18,520
Mr. Xue.

42
00:03:19,890 --> 00:03:22,420
It's not our fault
that the boat was unhooked.

43
00:03:22,829 --> 00:03:24,640
We found an axe on the winch

44
00:03:25,390 --> 00:03:26,650
on the southwest side.

45
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:29,790
It was flung from somewhere,
got stuck in the wood,

46
00:03:29,790 --> 00:03:30,920
and broke the rope.

47
00:03:31,230 --> 00:03:32,829
That's why things happened.

48
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,890
Do you think I'm a fool?

49
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:48,600
You think I'll believe you
just because you show me an axe?

50
00:03:53,350 --> 00:03:54,910
Do you think I'm a fool?

51
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,400
You scoundrels!

52
00:03:59,870 --> 00:04:01,970
You are dissatisfied
with the imperial court,

53
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:04,630
and deliberately blocked
the grain transport.

54
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:07,840
How many boats did you pull today?

55
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:11,360
Xue Baguan.

56
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:15,560
We've been pulling boats since noon,

57
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,240
without a moment's rest.

58
00:04:19,170 --> 00:04:21,050
The yamen promised us

59
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:24,000
2 meals for 12 hours of work,

60
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:27,430
with 2 steamed buns and a meat dish
for each person per meal.

61
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:28,290
But now,

62
00:04:29,050 --> 00:04:30,730
2 meals have been reduced to 1,

63
00:04:30,860 --> 00:04:32,260
and it's only served now.

64
00:04:32,860 --> 00:04:34,860
Where do we get the strength to work?

65
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:39,050
So it's for a bite of meat.

66
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:42,320
Eat!

67
00:04:44,909 --> 00:04:45,610
Eat!

68
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:48,260
Listen up, all of you!

69
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,000
Today,

70
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:54,740
if you don't hand over the rebel
who unhooked the grain ship,

71
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:56,680
I'll feed all the food to the dogs,

72
00:04:57,090 --> 00:04:58,860
and you won't get a single bite.

73
00:04:59,490 --> 00:05:01,050
Twenty lashes each,

74
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,090
until someone confesses.

75
00:05:04,050 --> 00:05:05,820
If no one steps forward today,

76
00:05:06,050 --> 00:05:07,310
none of you will leave.

77
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,660
You'll either kneel to death

78
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:10,880
or starve to death!

79
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:18,440
Xue Baguan.

80
00:05:20,030 --> 00:05:21,440
We are not criminals.

81
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,620
We are good citizens serving our corvée.

82
00:05:25,230 --> 00:05:26,410
The imperial court has its laws.

83
00:05:26,410 --> 00:05:28,150
How can you act so recklessly?

84
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:33,850
Kong Shiba.

85
00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:38,530
You’re just a down-and-out soldier.

86
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,930
Who do you think you are?

87
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:43,090
Ever since you came to
Huai'an Prefectural Office,

88
00:05:43,090 --> 00:05:44,920
you check the account books one day

89
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,600
and the food the next.

90
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:48,850
I know you're up to something.

91
00:05:53,150 --> 00:05:53,880
Yes.

92
00:05:55,590 --> 00:05:56,320
Yes.

93
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,530
Today, I

94
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:03,050
will speak out against
this injustice for everyone.

95
00:06:03,050 --> 00:06:05,610
The yamen scheduled
the dam shifts so tightly,

96
00:06:05,610 --> 00:06:07,610
yet you're still deducting our pay.

97
00:06:07,610 --> 00:06:09,140
How are we supposed to live?

98
00:06:10,110 --> 00:06:11,200
The sick can't get treated.

99
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,200
And there's no time to bury the dead.

100
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,970
This work is taking lives!

101
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,090
That's right.

102
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,520
And I'm taking your life first, old man!

103
00:06:21,650 --> 00:06:22,300
Move!

104
00:06:34,050 --> 00:06:35,200
Who dares

105
00:06:35,490 --> 00:06:36,760
to start a rebellion?

106
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:38,870
Take him away.

107
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,620
You're rebelling.

108
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:47,930
You're rebelling!

109
00:06:47,930 --> 00:06:49,130
We're not rebelling.

110
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,560
We have something to say.

111
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,240
We all have something to say!

112
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:54,650
Yes, we have something to say!

113
00:06:54,790 --> 00:06:57,320
We have something to say!

114
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:07,050
The scoundrel Xue is killing me!

115
00:07:07,050 --> 00:07:11,880
The scoundrel Xue is killing me!

116
00:07:18,370 --> 00:07:20,980
The scoundrel Xue is killing me!

117
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:24,320
Enough!

118
00:09:25,390 --> 00:09:26,720
Enough! Enough!

119
00:09:26,890 --> 00:09:28,840
Stop hitting him! Enough!

120
00:09:34,950 --> 00:09:36,140
Don't kill him.

121
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:39,210
Let's go.

122
00:09:46,130 --> 00:09:46,840
Eat slowly.

123
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:48,500
Okay.

124
00:09:48,530 --> 00:09:49,410
Eat your fill.

125
00:09:50,050 --> 00:09:52,450
I have more in the bucket
if it's not enough.

126
00:09:55,970 --> 00:09:57,100
One for each person.

127
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:21,230
Give some to those over there
who haven't gotten any.

128
00:10:21,230 --> 00:10:21,910
Okay, okay.

129
00:10:44,430 --> 00:10:45,760
Sitting here all alone?

130
00:10:48,670 --> 00:10:50,130
You look a bit unfamiliar.

131
00:10:51,050 --> 00:10:52,580
We haven't seen you before.

132
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,680
I just

133
00:11:00,770 --> 00:11:02,630
got transferred from over there.

134
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,760
You have good skills.

135
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,840
What's your name?

136
00:11:08,740 --> 00:11:10,200
My... My name is Hong Wang.

137
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,650
Hong Wang.

138
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,350
According to our custom,

139
00:11:13,350 --> 00:11:14,760
I'll call you Hong.

140
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:16,600
Hong.

141
00:11:17,220 --> 00:11:18,530
With your good skills,

142
00:11:18,730 --> 00:11:20,290
if you fell into the hands
of the prefectural office,

143
00:11:20,290 --> 00:11:21,570
it would be a real pity.

144
00:11:23,290 --> 00:11:24,410
Remember to throw away

145
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:25,330
this short stick later.

146
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:26,610
If anyone asks,

147
00:11:27,430 --> 00:11:29,230
just say you've never been here.

148
00:11:34,890 --> 00:11:35,530
Kong.

149
00:11:36,650 --> 00:11:39,560
What are you planning to do next?

150
00:11:39,770 --> 00:11:41,370
It's very simple.

151
00:11:42,610 --> 00:11:44,470
I will go and turn myself in alone.

152
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:53,180
You're going to turn yourself in alone?

153
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:55,010
Aren't you rising in rebellion?

154
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:56,840
Rising...

155
00:11:57,890 --> 00:11:59,130
Rising in rebellion?

156
00:11:59,650 --> 00:12:01,170
This phrase isn't something
ordinary people

157
00:12:01,170 --> 00:12:02,410
would say.

158
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:03,680
Hong,

159
00:12:04,350 --> 00:12:05,750
you're quite something.

160
00:12:06,930 --> 00:12:08,730
The dam official over at my place

161
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:10,890
often said that,

162
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:13,560
so I remembered it.

163
00:12:14,250 --> 00:12:16,530
Hong, think about it.

164
00:12:17,170 --> 00:12:19,200
Do you really think we're going to rebel?

165
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,250
Just us trackers,

166
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:24,090
brothers, and fellow villagers rebelling?

167
00:12:25,330 --> 00:12:26,280
Who would dare?

168
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,730
No one.

169
00:12:28,420 --> 00:12:29,540
You say that,

170
00:12:30,970 --> 00:12:34,680
but what about the wooden sticks,
whistles, and slogans?

171
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,660
Haven't you been planning this
for a long time?

172
00:12:40,890 --> 00:12:42,560
It's all for a bite to eat.

173
00:12:44,190 --> 00:12:44,880
Really.

174
00:12:46,370 --> 00:12:47,800
It's not for any big deal.

175
00:12:47,830 --> 00:12:49,520
Just for a bite to eat.

176
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:52,200
Hong,

177
00:12:52,550 --> 00:12:54,080
do you know that recently,

178
00:12:54,290 --> 00:12:56,890
many people in our batch
have starved to death?

179
00:12:58,440 --> 00:13:00,970
We can't stop while tracking.

180
00:13:02,180 --> 00:13:04,300
Some people collapse from exhaustion,

181
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:05,840
but we can't do anything about it.

182
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,170
We have to keep pulling.

183
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,560
So we just toss them to the side first

184
00:13:11,370 --> 00:13:13,200
and throw a mat over them.

185
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,570
They just lie pitifully there,

186
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,890
soaking in the filthy water.

187
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:22,130
A living person,

188
00:13:22,250 --> 00:13:23,920
gone just like that.

189
00:13:27,350 --> 00:13:29,130
No doctors, no proper burial.

190
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:41,770
These dam officials supervising
the tracking won't care,

191
00:13:41,770 --> 00:13:43,830
let alone offer compensation money.

192
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,540
Don't even think about it.

193
00:13:45,650 --> 00:13:48,530
Some of the annual funds allocated
by the imperial court

194
00:13:48,530 --> 00:13:49,800
for canal transport

195
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:52,390
have been embezzled by unknown people.

196
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:54,290
I can't talk about it.

197
00:13:54,290 --> 00:13:55,850
It just makes me angry.

198
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,970
It's just to make a living.

199
00:13:57,990 --> 00:13:59,530
It's just for a bite to eat.

200
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,660
What's the big deal?

201
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:19,440
Kong.

202
00:14:21,050 --> 00:14:22,290
Can making such a fuss

203
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:24,410
change anything?

204
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:25,840
As far as I know,

205
00:14:26,430 --> 00:14:28,910
the imperial court is most afraid
of this kind of riot.

206
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:30,720
If it is not strongly suppressed,

207
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,250
once a bad precedent is set,

208
00:14:34,060 --> 00:14:36,210
incidents of unruly people
resisting the law

209
00:14:36,210 --> 00:14:37,940
will emerge one after another.

210
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,250
Look at that, Hong.

211
00:14:41,250 --> 00:14:42,380
You are quite bright

212
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:43,700
and have some foresight.

213
00:14:43,700 --> 00:14:44,530
But you don't know that

214
00:14:44,530 --> 00:14:47,290
those officials are prideful

215
00:14:47,530 --> 00:14:48,790
and afraid of trouble.

216
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:50,320
If they arrest all of us,

217
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,650
who will work at the dam?

218
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:53,600
What about the canal transport?

219
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:55,720
If I go to the yamen

220
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:57,510
and surrender myself,

221
00:14:57,890 --> 00:14:59,650
the official will be able to save face.

222
00:14:59,650 --> 00:15:00,780
The chief culprit will be punished,

223
00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:02,290
and the rest will not be investigated.

224
00:15:02,290 --> 00:15:05,890
At least in the future,
no one will dare to withhold food rations,

225
00:15:09,010 --> 00:15:11,870
and the folks will more or less
have a way to survive.

226
00:15:16,430 --> 00:15:17,910
Just for this bite of food?

227
00:15:19,590 --> 00:15:20,620
What do you think?

228
00:15:22,510 --> 00:15:23,890
While we're alive,

229
00:15:24,530 --> 00:15:25,910
we hope for full meals

230
00:15:26,050 --> 00:15:27,290
so we don't starve.

231
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,600
When we die,

232
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:32,550
we hope to afford a coffin

233
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:34,650
to protect our bodies

234
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:37,750
from being fed on by dogs and crows.

235
00:15:39,050 --> 00:15:41,400
That's all the common people hope for.

236
00:15:42,050 --> 00:15:42,670
Really.

237
00:17:11,910 --> 00:17:12,480
Kong.

238
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:15,130
Judging from

239
00:17:16,290 --> 00:17:17,160
your skills,

240
00:17:18,170 --> 00:17:19,829
you must have been in the army.

241
00:17:21,349 --> 00:17:22,680
What makes you say that?

242
00:17:26,069 --> 00:17:27,130
I’m just guessing.

243
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,530
Then you guessed wrong.

244
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:31,930
I am just an honest old ox

245
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,500
that can plow the field.

246
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:36,870
Plowing a field is no different
from pulling a towline.

247
00:17:36,870 --> 00:17:38,570
It happens to be the off-season
for farming right now,

248
00:17:38,570 --> 00:17:40,000
so I came to the dam to work

249
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:41,410
for a bite to eat.

250
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,560
If you go to surrender,

251
00:17:46,010 --> 00:17:47,380
you will lose your head.

252
00:17:50,570 --> 00:17:51,410
Hong,

253
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:53,090
we have never met before,

254
00:17:53,710 --> 00:17:55,440
yet you care about me like this.

255
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:57,240
I am very touched.

256
00:17:57,940 --> 00:17:58,740
It's alright.

257
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,140
No one died.

258
00:18:00,910 --> 00:18:02,910
My crime is not punishable by death.

259
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:05,240
At most, I'll get a few dozen beatings.

260
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:07,640
It doesn't matter.
It's not the first time.

261
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,040
Speaking of which,

262
00:18:09,350 --> 00:18:11,270
you went all out beating Xue Baguan.

263
00:18:11,270 --> 00:18:12,610
You were ruthless.

264
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,340
I couldn't even hold you back.

265
00:18:14,540 --> 00:18:15,930
If you actually beat him to death,

266
00:18:15,930 --> 00:18:18,130
we won’t be able to account for it today.

267
00:18:19,610 --> 00:18:21,270
Kong, one ran away over there!

268
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:22,930
What's going on?

269
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:26,940
Don't chase after him!

270
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:27,720
Let him run.

271
00:18:28,350 --> 00:18:29,170
He should run.

272
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,440
Yes.

273
00:18:31,890 --> 00:18:32,490
Come back.

274
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:33,900
Come back, all of you.

275
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:35,360
Hurry up.

276
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:37,870
Everyone, throw away
the sticks in your hands.

277
00:18:37,870 --> 00:18:39,330
Hurry up. Throw them away.

278
00:18:40,020 --> 00:18:41,150
Throw them all away.

279
00:18:44,020 --> 00:18:45,280
It's best to burn them.

280
00:19:42,570 --> 00:19:43,370
You're awake.

281
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:46,950
This is a branch of the Iron Alliance.
It's very safe.

282
00:19:55,780 --> 00:19:58,440
Are all of you in the Iron Alliance
sick in the head?

283
00:19:58,440 --> 00:20:00,100
One minute you want to save me,

284
00:20:00,650 --> 00:20:02,840
the next, you want to hack me to pieces.

285
00:20:03,220 --> 00:20:04,550
Are you messing with me?

286
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,940
Uncle Liang means no harm.

287
00:20:11,090 --> 00:20:12,330
He's just inflexible

288
00:20:12,460 --> 00:20:15,610
and has been carrying out
the mission to kill the Crown Prince.

289
00:20:15,610 --> 00:20:16,680
It won't happen again.

290
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:17,810
There is no "again"!

291
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:18,900
Let me tell you.

292
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:21,890
I don't want anything to do
with your Iron Alliance.

293
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:23,170
Where is my sister?

294
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:25,610
Want to see her?

295
00:20:25,610 --> 00:20:26,330
Of course.

296
00:20:27,370 --> 00:20:28,970
Come with me to a place first.

297
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:30,200
Let's go.

298
00:20:33,380 --> 00:20:35,200
Are you guys really sick in the head?

299
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:35,930
Hurry up.

300
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:57,000
Where is Yulu?

301
00:20:57,860 --> 00:20:59,930
Didn't you say you'd bring me to see her?

302
00:20:59,930 --> 00:21:00,660
Where is she?

303
00:21:03,070 --> 00:21:04,670
There is a story from the past

304
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:06,440
that I must tell you.

305
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:10,260
Yulu is naive

306
00:21:10,370 --> 00:21:11,570
and easily deceived.

307
00:21:11,610 --> 00:21:12,470
I'm different.

308
00:21:12,740 --> 00:21:14,270
I'm not that easily fooled.

309
00:21:15,280 --> 00:21:16,680
Whatever you want to say,

310
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:19,340
you should think carefully
before you tell me.

311
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:21,540
After hearing it,
whether you stay or leave,

312
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:22,800
believe it or doubt it,

313
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:25,050
it's entirely up to you.

314
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:28,460
In the fourth year of Jianwen,

315
00:21:28,460 --> 00:21:31,540
Zhong Eryong and a few men
planned to break into the prison.

316
00:21:31,540 --> 00:21:32,340
Wait a minute.

317
00:21:32,490 --> 00:21:35,890
The fourth year of Jianwen?
You weren't even born yet, right?

318
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:39,560
Yes. The Iron Alliance Leader
told me about this.

319
00:21:41,310 --> 00:21:44,440
It was said that they planned
to cross the Qinhuai River,

320
00:21:44,540 --> 00:21:46,310
sneak into the Imperial Music Office,

321
00:21:46,310 --> 00:21:47,970
and rescue Tie Xuan's family.

322
00:21:48,310 --> 00:21:50,710
But in the end,
Zhong Eryong didn't show up.

323
00:22:00,350 --> 00:22:01,350
After that night,

324
00:22:02,330 --> 00:22:04,330
Zhong Eryong never appeared again.

325
00:22:05,770 --> 00:22:07,370
No one knew where he went.

326
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,370
Who is Zhong Eryong?

327
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:11,200
Why are you telling me about him?

328
00:22:11,210 --> 00:22:13,410
Some said he was dead.

329
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:15,580
Others said he went elsewhere.

330
00:22:15,930 --> 00:22:17,790
In short, no one could say for sure.

331
00:22:17,790 --> 00:22:19,850
What does all this have to do with me?

332
00:22:22,910 --> 00:22:24,330
Your father, Wu Buping, used to be

333
00:22:24,330 --> 00:22:25,570
just an ordinary man.

334
00:22:25,870 --> 00:22:28,240
We checked his background
at the Ministry of Revenue.

335
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,440
Between the 32nd year of Hongwu

336
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:30,790
and the 35th year of Hongwu,

337
00:22:30,790 --> 00:22:33,520
he was not in
Yingtian Prefectural Office at all.

338
00:22:34,760 --> 00:22:36,000
When he came back,

339
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:38,960
it was like he was a different person.

340
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:42,090
He became the Iron Lion
who solved many major cases

341
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,930
and became the
Chief of the Three Constable Squads.

342
00:22:44,930 --> 00:22:47,610
This change is truly baffling.

343
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:48,840
If you have something to say,
say it straight.

344
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:50,900
Don't beat around the bush. Speak up.

345
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:56,730
Wu Buping had already admitted

346
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:59,640
that he was the Zhong Eryong
from back then.

347
00:23:00,940 --> 00:23:01,930
That is to say,

348
00:23:03,930 --> 00:23:05,860
Zhong Eryong didn't die back then.

349
00:23:06,870 --> 00:23:08,890
He just hid his identity
and went into hiding.

350
00:23:07,660 --> 00:23:11,000
[Mr. Zhong Eryong]

351
00:23:11,520 --> 00:23:13,120
I'm in charge of this family.

352
00:23:13,360 --> 00:23:14,690
Get your things packed.

353
00:23:14,930 --> 00:23:15,730
In a day or two,

354
00:23:15,830 --> 00:23:17,760
the three of us will leave Jinling.

355
00:23:18,390 --> 00:23:20,790
So you forced my father
to kneel and beat him

356
00:23:22,810 --> 00:23:25,270
just because he betrayed
the Iron Alliance?

357
00:23:26,930 --> 00:23:27,760
You're wrong.

358
00:23:29,260 --> 00:23:30,720
We just wanted to find you.

359
00:23:31,700 --> 00:23:32,480
Find me?

360
00:23:33,570 --> 00:23:34,680
Find me for what?

361
00:23:35,610 --> 00:23:36,610
Aren't you curious

362
00:23:36,610 --> 00:23:39,340
why he changed his identity
and went into hiding?

363
00:23:39,570 --> 00:23:40,230
Because of me?

364
00:23:40,230 --> 00:23:40,820
Yes.

365
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:44,260
Zhong Eryong didn't have a son at all.

366
00:23:44,390 --> 00:23:45,650
He only had a daughter,

367
00:23:46,430 --> 00:23:47,200
who is Yulu.

368
00:23:48,680 --> 00:23:50,960
I'm here, I'm here!

369
00:23:51,090 --> 00:23:52,150
-My son.
-I’m here.

370
00:23:53,590 --> 00:23:54,310
My son.

371
00:23:54,370 --> 00:23:55,720
Remember,

372
00:23:56,020 --> 00:23:59,260
no matter what happens...

373
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:04,440
You're my son... Wu Buping's son...

374
00:24:13,760 --> 00:24:14,720
So my father

375
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:18,220
didn't want me to know my background.

376
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:18,850
Exactly.

377
00:24:21,780 --> 00:24:24,070
He didn't want you to get caught up
in any trouble.

378
00:24:24,070 --> 00:24:26,400
He just wanted you
to live a peaceful life.

379
00:24:26,810 --> 00:24:27,520
No, Father.

380
00:24:27,760 --> 00:24:28,280
No.

381
00:24:28,590 --> 00:24:29,850
If you're in any trouble,

382
00:24:29,850 --> 00:24:31,200
you have to tell me.

383
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:37,200
You can't be involved
in this case anymore.

384
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,060
We can't afford

385
00:24:38,770 --> 00:24:40,900
to offend the people involved in this.

386
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:42,720
Listen to me,

387
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,720
don't get involved in this anymore.

388
00:24:45,330 --> 00:24:46,930
What trouble could there be?

389
00:24:48,110 --> 00:24:49,310
Come with me to Jinan.

390
00:24:49,830 --> 00:24:51,560
Someone will explain it to you.

391
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:53,480
One moment you say

392
00:24:53,740 --> 00:24:54,480
you'll take me to see Yulu,

393
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:56,680
the next you say you'll take me to Jinan.

394
00:24:57,110 --> 00:24:58,170
How can I trust you?

395
00:24:58,520 --> 00:25:00,580
Zhong Eryong died at Zhengyang Gate.

396
00:25:00,810 --> 00:25:02,170
If we had no connection to him,

397
00:25:02,170 --> 00:25:03,730
why would we bother to snatch his body

398
00:25:03,730 --> 00:25:04,810
and bring him here?

399
00:25:10,980 --> 00:25:11,570
Yulu.

400
00:25:12,610 --> 00:25:13,200
Yulu!

401
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:21,220
Today is the day
your father was laid to rest.

402
00:25:21,700 --> 00:25:23,900
You two should talk things over calmly.

403
00:25:38,460 --> 00:25:39,000
Father.

404
00:25:40,590 --> 00:25:41,410
You said

405
00:25:41,790 --> 00:25:42,830
no matter what,

406
00:25:44,420 --> 00:25:46,510
I will always be Wu Buping's son.

407
00:25:48,410 --> 00:25:49,440
I remember that.

408
00:25:58,770 --> 00:25:59,330
Father.

409
00:26:00,470 --> 00:26:02,320
Whether I'm your biological son

410
00:26:03,850 --> 00:26:04,810
or not,

411
00:26:05,350 --> 00:26:06,410
it doesn't matter.

412
00:26:06,980 --> 00:26:08,170
I, Wu Dingyuan,

413
00:26:08,870 --> 00:26:10,730
only have one father in this life,

414
00:26:12,540 --> 00:26:13,400
and that's you.

415
00:26:16,300 --> 00:26:17,280
Don't worry.

416
00:26:18,830 --> 00:26:21,930
The people from the Iron Alliance
didn't do anything to me.

417
00:26:21,930 --> 00:26:23,370
I'm fine now.

418
00:26:25,170 --> 00:26:25,760
Father.

419
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:29,200
Rest in peace.

420
00:26:59,030 --> 00:27:00,050
Arrest them!

421
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:02,650
Listen up, everyone. Arrest them all!

422
00:27:02,650 --> 00:27:03,650
Yes!

423
00:27:04,130 --> 00:27:05,410
Hurry. Squat down!

424
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:06,480
Get down!

425
00:27:06,930 --> 00:27:07,520
Get down!

426
00:27:08,850 --> 00:27:09,520
Squat down.

427
00:27:11,170 --> 00:27:12,370
Get down. Hurry!

428
00:27:12,930 --> 00:27:13,520
Get down!

429
00:27:14,430 --> 00:27:15,040
Get down!

430
00:27:15,540 --> 00:27:16,360
Stop running!

431
00:27:24,810 --> 00:27:25,870
Squat down. Hurry!

432
00:27:26,130 --> 00:27:26,790
Don't move.

433
00:27:27,830 --> 00:27:28,890
Squat down. Hurry.

434
00:27:36,410 --> 00:27:37,070
Over there!

435
00:27:37,260 --> 00:27:38,000
Over there!

436
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:40,110
Arrest them all!

437
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:41,520
Yes!

438
00:27:41,610 --> 00:27:42,760
Commissioner Fang!

439
00:27:43,520 --> 00:27:45,010
It's all my fault!

440
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,700
It has nothing to do with them!

441
00:28:12,570 --> 00:28:13,570
My Lord!

442
00:28:17,150 --> 00:28:17,850
My Lord.

443
00:28:19,610 --> 00:28:20,330
My Lord.

444
00:28:22,150 --> 00:28:23,130
My Lord.

445
00:28:24,070 --> 00:28:26,130
I failed to suppress them.

446
00:28:26,570 --> 00:28:28,960
I almost let these scoundrels succeed.

447
00:28:29,670 --> 00:28:31,870
Good thing you arrived in time, My Lord.

448
00:28:32,090 --> 00:28:34,150
My Lord, not only did you save my life,

449
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:37,090
but you also let them know the law exists!

450
00:28:37,540 --> 00:28:38,930
If they keep making trouble like this,

451
00:28:38,930 --> 00:28:40,570
they'll meet their doom.

452
00:28:40,980 --> 00:28:41,650
My Lord,

453
00:28:42,220 --> 00:28:44,280
we must make an example of them.

454
00:28:46,330 --> 00:28:46,930
Get up.

455
00:28:49,670 --> 00:28:51,480
Why did they start fighting?

456
00:28:52,020 --> 00:28:52,570
Go.

457
00:28:52,940 --> 00:28:54,650
Call their leader here.

458
00:28:54,870 --> 00:28:56,890
I want to hear what the reason is.

459
00:28:57,130 --> 00:28:57,760
My Lord,

460
00:28:58,180 --> 00:28:59,670
they are all unruly people.

461
00:28:59,670 --> 00:29:01,650
You should stay as far from them
as possible, My Lord.

462
00:29:01,650 --> 00:29:03,040
Even if there is a reason,

463
00:29:03,040 --> 00:29:04,970
they are just making trouble here.

464
00:29:05,410 --> 00:29:07,520
Let me get their confessions first.

465
00:29:07,830 --> 00:29:09,180
Once we find out what the problem is,

466
00:29:09,180 --> 00:29:11,710
it won't be too late
for you to step in, My Lord.

467
00:29:12,200 --> 00:29:13,810
From yesterday until now,

468
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:16,520
have you seen any unfamiliar faces?

469
00:29:17,540 --> 00:29:18,800
Just answer directly.

470
00:29:20,260 --> 00:29:22,110
We are always short of hands at the dam.

471
00:29:22,110 --> 00:29:24,630
What kind of background
could a bunch of boat trackers have?

472
00:29:24,630 --> 00:29:26,330
Some are hiding from murder cases,

473
00:29:26,330 --> 00:29:27,390
and some owe gambling debts.

474
00:29:27,390 --> 00:29:28,870
As long as they have strength, it's fine.

475
00:29:28,870 --> 00:29:30,850
It's normal to see unfamiliar faces.

476
00:29:30,850 --> 00:29:32,400
They are dressed in rags

477
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:35,000
and all look malnourished.

478
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:35,930
Most of them

479
00:29:35,930 --> 00:29:37,930
are just trying to get a full meal.

480
00:29:39,460 --> 00:29:41,590
Are the trackers getting enough food?

481
00:29:41,670 --> 00:29:43,300
Yes, absolutely.

482
00:29:43,650 --> 00:29:45,250
They're properly fed for their hard work.

483
00:29:45,250 --> 00:29:46,450
No deductions at all.

484
00:29:48,100 --> 00:29:50,860
Good. As long as you know.

485
00:30:04,240 --> 00:30:06,900
If anyone dares to steal
food from the trackers,

486
00:30:06,940 --> 00:30:09,180
they are deliberately
messing with the canal transport.

487
00:30:09,180 --> 00:30:11,000
My Lord, I wouldn't dare.

488
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:14,280
It's true that
the grain ship capsizing yesterday

489
00:30:14,350 --> 00:30:15,480
caused some delay.

490
00:30:15,500 --> 00:30:16,430
Enough talking.

491
00:30:17,020 --> 00:30:17,950
Here's the plan.

492
00:30:18,090 --> 00:30:19,500
Arrange for a doctor first

493
00:30:19,500 --> 00:30:21,370
to treat the men's injuries at the yamen.

494
00:30:21,370 --> 00:30:23,810
Then pick out
the trackers who led the riot

495
00:30:23,840 --> 00:30:26,240
and send them to the prison
at the Ministry of Justice Branch.

496
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:28,170
Pacify the rest as soon as possible

497
00:30:28,330 --> 00:30:30,260
and get them back to work on the dam.

498
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:31,080
Remember,

499
00:30:31,400 --> 00:30:34,330
the canal transport
cannot stop for a single moment.

500
00:30:34,410 --> 00:30:35,040
Yes.

501
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:39,260
The guilty party is the first to cry foul.

502
00:31:00,840 --> 00:31:02,240
Where's your arrogance?

503
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:06,570
Swallowed it back, huh?

504
00:31:06,850 --> 00:31:07,650
How arrogant.

505
00:31:08,330 --> 00:31:09,530
He's the ringleader.

506
00:31:10,590 --> 00:31:11,590
Behave yourself!

507
00:32:06,870 --> 00:32:08,520
Take these guys back.

508
00:32:10,520 --> 00:32:11,910
And that old geezer,

509
00:32:13,540 --> 00:32:14,540
take him back too.

510
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:18,520
Move!

511
00:32:19,330 --> 00:32:19,930
Get up!

512
00:32:20,870 --> 00:32:22,070
Move! Take them away!

513
00:32:23,090 --> 00:32:24,290
Go. Keep up. Hurry up.

514
00:32:24,330 --> 00:32:26,060
Stop dawdling. Hurry up. Move.

515
00:32:26,760 --> 00:32:28,420
Walk faster. Can you hurry up?

516
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,240
Hurry up.

517
00:32:29,590 --> 00:32:30,570
Be quick. Move.

518
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:31,850
Hurry up.

519
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:32,890
Hurry.

520
00:32:34,070 --> 00:32:35,400
Hurry up. Do you hear me?

521
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:38,760
I'll whip you to death.

522
00:32:38,760 --> 00:32:39,650
Hurry up.

523
00:32:41,330 --> 00:32:42,650
Move!

524
00:32:44,370 --> 00:32:45,040
Hurry up!

525
00:32:53,170 --> 00:32:53,970
Young Master.

526
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,520
Young Master?

527
00:33:02,260 --> 00:33:03,060
Young Master.

528
00:33:03,610 --> 00:33:04,570
Rectifier Yu...

529
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:08,240
Young Master!

530
00:33:18,040 --> 00:33:19,170
Rectifier Yu...

531
00:33:20,570 --> 00:33:21,610
Yu Qian!

532
00:33:22,370 --> 00:33:23,170
Young Master!

533
00:33:26,090 --> 00:33:27,170
Rectifier Yu...

534
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:30,570
Yu Qian...

535
00:33:32,150 --> 00:33:33,200
Yu Qian...

536
00:33:41,340 --> 00:33:42,000
Where is he?

537
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,590
Where is Zhu Zhanji?

538
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:45,620
[Zhu Zhanyu,
Fifth Son of the Prince of Han]

539
00:33:44,320 --> 00:33:47,200
You came to see me
without even finding a trace of him.

540
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:48,600
Calm down, Young Master.

541
00:33:48,670 --> 00:33:51,130
I am definitely
not making baseless claims.

542
00:33:51,930 --> 00:33:53,260
Tell me your deduction.

543
00:33:54,870 --> 00:33:55,780
According to reports,

544
00:33:55,780 --> 00:33:57,380
the boat destroyed at the dam

545
00:33:57,590 --> 00:33:59,540
was indeed Wang Ji's tribute vessel.

546
00:33:59,540 --> 00:34:00,370
During that time,

547
00:34:00,370 --> 00:34:02,200
only this boat passed by.

548
00:34:02,310 --> 00:34:03,700
Therefore, I conclude that

549
00:34:03,700 --> 00:34:06,110
Zhu Zhanji and his men
must have been on the boat.

550
00:34:06,110 --> 00:34:08,250
But when the canal transport soldiers
inspected the boat,

551
00:34:08,250 --> 00:34:09,780
they found no trace of them,

552
00:34:10,040 --> 00:34:11,409
not even a corpse.

553
00:34:13,100 --> 00:34:13,850
Go on.

554
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:16,409
I am indeed guilty of negligence.

555
00:34:17,500 --> 00:34:19,409
As the saying goes,
misfortunes never come singly.

556
00:34:19,409 --> 00:34:22,540
We were then caught up
in a riot by the trackers on the dam.

557
00:34:23,080 --> 00:34:25,250
Commander Wang of the Huai'an Guard also

558
00:34:25,250 --> 00:34:26,380
died mysteriously.

559
00:34:26,710 --> 00:34:29,510
So because of the chaos,
we couldn't investigate.

560
00:34:31,100 --> 00:34:33,280
Now that you put it that way,
I understand.

561
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:35,630
You must not treat these incidents
as coincidences.

562
00:34:35,630 --> 00:34:36,960
They must be connected.

563
00:34:37,300 --> 00:34:39,949
This chaos is no coincidence.

564
00:34:40,900 --> 00:34:42,960
Zhu Zhanji is definitely in Huai'an.

565
00:34:44,170 --> 00:34:45,460
You are wise, Young Master.

566
00:34:45,460 --> 00:34:46,370
I understand.

567
00:34:46,489 --> 00:34:48,460
I will send someone
to continue the investigation.

568
00:34:48,460 --> 00:34:49,040
Wait.

569
00:34:53,370 --> 00:34:55,969
Has everything in Yangzhou
been taken care of?

570
00:34:57,180 --> 00:34:58,780
Rest assured, Young Master.

571
00:34:59,270 --> 00:35:00,330
Of the Wang family,

572
00:35:00,430 --> 00:35:01,410
no one survived.

573
00:35:06,710 --> 00:35:09,460
[Huai'an]

574
00:35:09,560 --> 00:35:10,080
Move!

575
00:35:10,330 --> 00:35:10,830
Move!

576
00:35:10,960 --> 00:35:11,580
Go.

577
00:35:12,520 --> 00:35:13,000
Go.

578
00:35:13,060 --> 00:35:14,190
Gently. Move aside.

579
00:35:14,330 --> 00:35:14,790
Move.

580
00:35:14,990 --> 00:35:15,760
Hurry up.

581
00:35:15,780 --> 00:35:16,900
Hurry up. Move.

582
00:35:17,080 --> 00:35:17,940
Hurry up. Move.

583
00:35:20,040 --> 00:35:20,520
Move.

584
00:35:20,850 --> 00:35:21,370
Move.

585
00:35:22,210 --> 00:35:23,080
Moving.

586
00:35:23,520 --> 00:35:24,040
Hurry.

587
00:35:27,970 --> 00:35:30,370
Who did my father break into
the prison to save?

588
00:35:30,370 --> 00:35:31,480
Tie Xuan's family.

589
00:35:32,830 --> 00:35:33,480
Tie Xuan?

590
00:35:34,710 --> 00:35:37,440
What was my father's relationship
with Tie Xuan?

591
00:35:38,160 --> 00:35:40,310
The Alliance Leader will tell you
when we get to Jinan.

592
00:35:40,310 --> 00:35:41,390
When did I ever say

593
00:35:41,390 --> 00:35:42,990
I was going to Jinan with you?

594
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,330
Along the way,

595
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,980
the Iron Alliance has helped you a lot.

596
00:35:45,980 --> 00:35:47,520
Now that we've reunited
you and your sister,

597
00:35:47,520 --> 00:35:49,500
it's fine if you don't thank us,

598
00:35:49,730 --> 00:35:51,870
but you should at least
show some appreciation.

599
00:35:51,870 --> 00:35:52,960
Why should I

600
00:35:53,930 --> 00:35:55,000
show you any appreciation?

601
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:55,930
Move aside!

602
00:35:57,560 --> 00:35:58,060
Move.

603
00:36:01,910 --> 00:36:02,440
Move.

604
00:36:02,830 --> 00:36:03,370
Move.

605
00:36:04,620 --> 00:36:05,370
Hurry up.

606
00:36:15,500 --> 00:36:16,560
Someone you know?

607
00:36:22,910 --> 00:36:24,570
I wonder where these soldiers

608
00:36:24,830 --> 00:36:26,760
escorting the trackers came from.

609
00:36:28,520 --> 00:36:29,650
Can you do me a favor?

610
00:36:32,120 --> 00:36:34,520
[Huai'an Ministry of Justice Branch]

611
00:36:33,890 --> 00:36:35,040
Go. Hurry up!

612
00:36:36,770 --> 00:36:37,960
Hurry up. Go.

613
00:36:38,830 --> 00:36:39,960
Move inside. Hurry.

614
00:36:40,770 --> 00:36:41,520
Behave.

615
00:36:41,730 --> 00:36:42,480
Move.

616
00:36:42,870 --> 00:36:43,560
Hurry up.

617
00:36:44,120 --> 00:36:44,690
Go.

618
00:36:46,290 --> 00:36:46,960
Let go.

619
00:36:48,080 --> 00:36:48,730
Hurry up.

620
00:36:49,080 --> 00:36:49,810
Move faster.

621
00:36:49,250 --> 00:36:52,060
[Fei Laotou]

622
00:36:50,430 --> 00:36:52,210
Go over there. Hurry up.

623
00:36:53,250 --> 00:36:53,810
Go.

624
00:36:56,040 --> 00:36:56,700
Master Xue,

625
00:36:57,160 --> 00:36:58,080
what's going on?

626
00:36:58,080 --> 00:36:59,480
A big deal has come.

627
00:37:01,960 --> 00:37:03,020
Keep up in the back.

628
00:37:03,250 --> 00:37:03,690
Move.

629
00:37:03,740 --> 00:37:04,900
That old geezer.

630
00:37:05,080 --> 00:37:06,410
See the oldest one?

631
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:08,240
His name is Kong Shiba.

632
00:37:08,240 --> 00:37:10,550
The fair-skinned kid next to him

633
00:37:11,120 --> 00:37:12,520
is the most ruthless.

634
00:37:14,310 --> 00:37:14,960
Got it.

635
00:37:17,250 --> 00:37:17,930
Master Xue.

636
00:37:18,850 --> 00:37:20,510
These are just boat trackers.

637
00:37:20,610 --> 00:37:23,540
You won't get much profit
even if you skin them alive.

638
00:37:24,640 --> 00:37:27,120
This is no ordinary troublemaking.

639
00:37:27,480 --> 00:37:30,290
It was instigated by others
as a deliberate plot.

640
00:37:35,410 --> 00:37:36,140
Understood.

641
00:37:37,520 --> 00:37:38,580
They want to rebel.

642
00:37:41,850 --> 00:37:43,560
Lord Fei, you have

643
00:37:43,960 --> 00:37:45,930
great foresight now.

644
00:37:49,350 --> 00:37:51,770
We're securing
the foundation of the state,

645
00:37:51,770 --> 00:37:53,500
maintaining local stability,

646
00:37:53,560 --> 00:37:55,940
and quelling the machinations of traitors.

647
00:37:55,940 --> 00:37:59,740
The Ministry of Justice Branch
won't be stingy in paying us for that.

648
00:38:02,290 --> 00:38:03,520
Before the interrogation,

649
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:04,920
don't let them stay idle.

650
00:38:05,200 --> 00:38:06,950
Take them down a peg or two.

651
00:38:11,090 --> 00:38:12,550
Rest assured, Master Xue.

652
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,400
Once they are in my hands,

653
00:38:14,560 --> 00:38:16,440
a dragon will have its sinews pulled,

654
00:38:16,440 --> 00:38:17,290
and a tiger

655
00:38:17,880 --> 00:38:18,970
will be skinned.

656
00:38:26,810 --> 00:38:29,140
You're the tough guys from the dam, right?

657
00:38:29,730 --> 00:38:30,590
Let me tell you,

658
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:32,450
once you're in here,

659
00:38:32,450 --> 00:38:34,780
I'll crush you
even if you're made of iron.

660
00:38:36,140 --> 00:38:36,930
Listen up.

661
00:38:37,600 --> 00:38:39,480
Once you're in the prison
of the Ministry of Justice Branch,

662
00:38:39,480 --> 00:38:40,940
you must follow the prison's rules.

663
00:38:40,940 --> 00:38:41,560
First,

664
00:38:42,620 --> 00:38:45,290
you must kneel when you see an official.

665
00:38:46,120 --> 00:38:47,160
That's the rule.

666
00:38:50,190 --> 00:38:50,920
Understood.

667
00:38:51,460 --> 00:38:52,690
Come on, kneel down.

668
00:38:52,940 --> 00:38:53,600
Kneel.

669
00:38:53,940 --> 00:38:54,560
Hurry up.

670
00:38:55,480 --> 00:38:56,680
Kneel down, quickly.

671
00:39:07,350 --> 00:39:09,080
Silly boy, kneel down quickly.

672
00:39:12,330 --> 00:39:12,690
You.

673
00:39:12,690 --> 00:39:13,890
Silly boy, come on...

674
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:14,800
Step forward.

675
00:39:21,560 --> 00:39:23,090
Your knees are quite stiff.

676
00:39:23,930 --> 00:39:24,860
Can't bend them?

677
00:39:33,620 --> 00:39:34,640
If I kneel,

678
00:39:35,920 --> 00:39:36,890
can you bear it?

679
00:39:39,790 --> 00:39:40,430
You're already here.

680
00:39:40,430 --> 00:39:42,000
What's there to bear or not?

681
00:39:42,350 --> 00:39:43,750
I can even take your life.

682
00:39:44,150 --> 00:39:44,710
Men.

683
00:39:46,520 --> 00:39:48,050
Hang the prison rules on him

684
00:39:48,350 --> 00:39:49,880
and let him learn the rules.

685
00:39:53,730 --> 00:39:54,480
Silly boy.

686
00:39:54,940 --> 00:39:55,940
Behave yourself.

687
00:40:05,770 --> 00:40:06,480
Lord Fei,

688
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:09,290
I apologize on behalf of the newcomer.

689
00:40:09,580 --> 00:40:10,770
Please don't hold it against him.

690
00:40:10,770 --> 00:40:11,760
He is young and arrogant,

691
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:13,190
and doesn't know the rules.

692
00:40:13,190 --> 00:40:15,250
The prison rules you just mentioned,

693
00:40:15,640 --> 00:40:17,080
I happen to remember them.

694
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:19,340
Let me read them to him
and the newcomers.

695
00:40:19,480 --> 00:40:20,690
The first rule is

696
00:40:22,310 --> 00:40:24,480
to strictly observe the law
and repent in peace.

697
00:40:24,480 --> 00:40:25,120
Second,

698
00:40:25,370 --> 00:40:26,700
respect your superiors

699
00:40:26,710 --> 00:40:27,870
and do not be disrespectful.

700
00:40:27,870 --> 00:40:30,960
Third, fighting is prohibited
in the prison.

701
00:40:31,560 --> 00:40:33,190
Violators will be
whipped at the very least.

702
00:40:33,190 --> 00:40:34,340
That's enough.

703
00:40:36,290 --> 00:40:37,600
You are Kong Shiba, right?

704
00:40:37,600 --> 00:40:38,270
Yes.

705
00:40:40,330 --> 00:40:41,770
You are quite protective.

706
00:40:41,770 --> 00:40:42,370
No, no.

707
00:40:42,450 --> 00:40:43,980
Just reading it to the boys.

708
00:40:45,330 --> 00:40:47,190
This senior of yours knelt for you

709
00:40:48,030 --> 00:40:49,690
and recited the rules for you.

710
00:40:51,080 --> 00:40:51,810
But,

711
00:40:52,440 --> 00:40:53,770
you still have to kneel.

712
00:40:54,390 --> 00:40:55,190
It's the rule.

713
00:41:14,480 --> 00:41:16,210
You silly boy.

714
00:41:16,640 --> 00:41:17,770
You're quite tough.

715
00:41:21,790 --> 00:41:22,770
Lord Fei, please!

716
00:41:22,770 --> 00:41:23,560
Shut up!

717
00:41:24,820 --> 00:41:26,640
I'll apologize in his stead!

718
00:41:27,210 --> 00:41:28,670
This kid is just ignorant.

719
00:41:28,980 --> 00:41:30,120
Look at him.

720
00:41:30,350 --> 00:41:31,910
Even I want to beat him up.

721
00:41:32,770 --> 00:41:33,900
Are you still tough?

722
00:41:47,370 --> 00:41:48,270
I found out.

723
00:41:50,750 --> 00:41:51,850
The guards escorting the trackers

724
00:41:51,850 --> 00:41:54,450
are soldiers borrowed from
the Huai'an Guard.

725
00:41:57,140 --> 00:41:58,750
What's the person in charge of
the Huai'an Guard

726
00:41:58,750 --> 00:41:59,440
called?

727
00:41:59,870 --> 00:42:00,930
Where does he live?

728
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:01,550
Wang Teng.

729
00:42:01,550 --> 00:42:04,150
He lives in the biggest house
in Qingyun Alley.

730
00:42:11,660 --> 00:42:14,290
Are you asking this
to save the Crown Prince?

731
00:42:17,730 --> 00:42:19,190
Breaking into the prison?

732
00:42:21,160 --> 00:42:22,000
To fish,

733
00:42:22,520 --> 00:42:24,770
a bamboo pole is enough.

734
00:42:25,940 --> 00:42:27,960
There's no need to jump into the water.

735
00:42:27,960 --> 00:42:30,020
How can you fish without getting wet?

736
00:42:30,710 --> 00:42:32,710
Besides, where is your fishing rod?

737
00:42:33,020 --> 00:42:34,480
It's in Wang Teng's house.

738
00:42:35,520 --> 00:42:37,120
What else do you want to know?

739
00:42:37,230 --> 00:42:38,330
Nothing else.

740
00:42:41,650 --> 00:42:43,400
Can you lend me two of your men?

741
00:42:48,350 --> 00:42:49,350
I can lend you men,

742
00:42:50,980 --> 00:42:52,000
but not for free.

743
00:42:53,830 --> 00:42:55,430
Are you negotiating with me?

744
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:57,810
Tell me, what do you want from me?

745
00:42:58,290 --> 00:42:59,440
You know what I want.

746
00:43:00,810 --> 00:43:02,470
Want me to go to Jinan with you?

747
00:43:06,370 --> 00:43:07,810
Help me this time first,

748
00:43:09,210 --> 00:43:09,930
and we'll figure it out later.
